    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the paws of a tiny mouse in <strong>I Am Mouse</strong>, a charming and funny third-person adventure where you create your own path.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/cdf90eb681f8653c4ecee9ec38da1d63.avif?t=1754068938\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight, sneak, or explore freely through rich environments full of choices, secrets, and alternate routes. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cute hero:</strong> just look at this mouse!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/d1a9afa9fd1212a3e938651495c4f4dc.poster.avif?t=1754068938\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/d1a9afa9fd1212a3e938651495c4f4dc.webm?t=1754068938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/d1a9afa9fd1212a3e938651495c4f4dc.mp4?t=1754068938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story mode:</strong> your home was destroyed. Find a new home and don't let your family die in this adventure!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/de651ab10ebf4e243e9dc184e33e24c6.poster.avif?t=1754068938\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/de651ab10ebf4e243e9dc184e33e24c6.webm?t=1754068938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/de651ab10ebf4e243e9dc184e33e24c6.mp4?t=1754068938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Payday mode:</strong> choose one of the available maps and start searching for food. Be careful! There is a man somewhere in the house... <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/b6809b0ad2ebf4b3b16de11d1ff28746.poster.avif?t=1754068938\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/b6809b0ad2ebf4b3b16de11d1ff28746.webm?t=1754068938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/b6809b0ad2ebf4b3b16de11d1ff28746.mp4?t=1754068938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Use your sense of smell</strong> to find traces of food and other useful things.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/f1ee3ae3f02db3c71745899a063b02a8.poster.avif?t=1754068938\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/f1ee3ae3f02db3c71745899a063b02a8.webm?t=1754068938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/f1ee3ae3f02db3c71745899a063b02a8.mp4?t=1754068938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Use all your opportunities:</strong> jump on different objects or climb on some cloth/wires to reach the goal.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/7e590d292c4eb92191b518ad2282577d.poster.avif?t=1754068938\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/7e590d292c4eb92191b518ad2282577d.webm?t=1754068938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/7e590d292c4eb92191b518ad2282577d.mp4?t=1754068938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Remember that you are a little mouse and use it:</strong> hide under the sofa, bed, nightstand and other things!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/20e53669f722f963ccd2203ee6280de0.poster.avif?t=1754068938\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/20e53669f722f963ccd2203ee6280de0.webm?t=1754068938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/20e53669f722f963ccd2203ee6280de0.mp4?t=1754068938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Running away from a person and stuck at a height? No problem:</strong> collect napkins and use them as a parachute!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/023927b8974ca030c4ce0d5a0ed9ccb6.poster.avif?t=1754068938\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/023927b8974ca030c4ce0d5a0ed9ccb6.webm?t=1754068938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/023927b8974ca030c4ce0d5a0ed9ccb6.mp4?t=1754068938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customize your mouse:</strong>  change the skin, eye color, grow a mustache and wear hats or tie.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/5a1b1b3252e26db700a7fb8ad821bf92.poster.avif?t=1754068938\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/5a1b1b3252e26db700a7fb8ad821bf92.webm?t=1754068938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/5a1b1b3252e26db700a7fb8ad821bf92.mp4?t=1754068938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul>",
